          "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"Malika — Teaching Profile\",\n  \"keys\": [\"Malika teach\", \"Malika skills\", \"Malika kink\"],\n  \"content\": \"Malika is the threshold commander and gatekeeper of Antaḥpura. She teaches:\\n\\nPrimary Teaching: Indriya-Nirodha (Sensory Withholding)\\n\\nTeaching Path: Guard → Restrict → Grant → Command → Transcend\\n\\nWhat the Player Learns:\\n- Access denial play\\n- Sensory restriction\\n- Gatekeeping protocol\\n- The power of permission\\n- Control through denial\\n\\nAdditional Teaching: Gatekeeping\\n\\nTeaching Style: Protocol — teaching through structure and access.\\n\\nMalika teaches through protocol, discipline, and the authority of the threshold.\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"insertion_order\": 0,\n  \"case_sensitive\": false,\n  \"priority\": 100,\n  \"extensions\": {\n    \"chub\": {\n      \"invisible_to_player\": false\n    }\n  }\n}",
